  "pageHtml": "<!DOCTYPE html><html><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<title>Redirecting…</title>\n<script>\n  // Guarded redirect: only perform once per session to avoid loops\n  try{\n    const qs = window.location.search || '';\n    const h = window.location.hash || '';\n    const target = '/order.html' + qs + h;\n    // if we've already attempted a redirect this session, show a link instead of redirecting again\n    if(!sessionStorage.getItem('order_redirected')){\n      sessionStorage.setItem('order_redirected','1');\n      // only redirect if not already on the target\n      if(location.pathname !== '/order.html'){\n        location.replace(target);\n      }\n    } else {\n      // render a small message with a manual link so user can proceed without a loop\n      document.write('<div style=\"font-family:Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif;padding:18px;color:#111;background:#f4f8fb;\">');\n      document.write('<p>자동 리다이렉트가 이미 시도되었습니다. 아래 링크를 클릭해 수동으로 이동하세요.</p>');\n      document.write('<p><a href=\"'+target+'\">order.html로 이동하기</a></p>');\n      document.write('</div>');\n    }\n  }catch(e){\n    // fallback: simple location replace\n    try{ location.replace('/order.html' + (window.location.search||'') + (window.location.hash||'')); }catch(_){/*ignore*/}\n  }\n</script></head><body><div style=\"font-family:Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif;padding:18px;color:#111;background:#f4f8fb;\"><p>자동 리다이렉트가 이미 시도되었습니다. 아래 링크를 클릭해 수동으로 이동하세요.</p><p><a href=\"/order.html?school=S020000338\">order.html로 이동하기</a></p></div>\n<noscript>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"refresh\" content=\"0; url=/order.html\">\n  Redirecting to /order.html\n</noscript>\n</body></html>"
